@host = http://localhost:16607
@clientId = mcp-client
@clientSecret = mcp-secret

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
###  Yzl.Extensions.Samples.Mcp.Service — 手工测试集合
###
###  前置条件：
###    1. 启动 MCP 服务端：
###       dotnet run --project src/Yzl.Extensions.Samples.Mcp.Service
###       （监听 16607）
###    2. /feign-test 需要同时启动 Samples.Api（16600）：
###       dotnet run --project src/Samples.Api
###
###  说明：
###    /mcp 端点开启了 JWT Bearer 认证，因此每个请求都要带 Authorization 头。
###    下面的「获取 Token」请求执行后，VS Code REST Client 会把响应中的
###    accessToken 自动写入 {{token}} 变量（见该请求的 @name / 响应处理说明）。
###    若使用其他客户端，请手工复制 accessToken 到下面的 @token 中。
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ── 0. 服务根路径（无需认证）──
GET {{host}}/

### ── 1. 获取 JWT Token ──
# 校验失败会返回 401；成功返回 { accessToken, tokenType, expiresIn }
# VS Code REST Client 用户：把下面响应的 accessToken 复制到 @token 即可。
POST {{host}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
    "clientSecret": "{{clientSecret}}"
}

### ── 2. 未认证访问 /mcp（应返回 401）──
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "id": 1,
    "method": "tools/list"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
###  以下请求均需认证。请把第 1 步拿到的 accessToken 粘贴到 @token。
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
@token = 在此粘贴 accessToken

### ── 3. 获取工具列表 ──
# 返回 calculator 的 add / subtract / echo、get_current_time、days_until、
# is_weekend、age、GetById、GetByIdAsync 等工具。
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "id": 2,
    "method": "tools/list"
}

### ── 4. 调用 add 工具（3 + 5 = 8）──
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "id": 3,
    "method": "tools/call",
    "params": {
        "name": "add",
        "arguments": {
            "a": 3,
            "b": 5
        }
    }
}

### ── 5. 调用 subtract 工具（10 - 4 = 6）──
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "id": 4,
    "method": "tools/call",
    "params": {
        "name": "subtract",
        "arguments": {
            "a": 10,
            "b": 4
        }
    }
}

### ── 6. 调用 echo 工具（重复 3 次）──
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "id": 5,
    "method": "tools/call",
    "params": {
        "name": "echo",
        "arguments": {
            "message": "hello",
            "count": 3
        }
    }
}

### ── 7. 获取当前时间 ──
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "id": 6,
    "method": "tools/call",
    "params": {
        "name": "get_current_time"
    }
}

### ── 8. 计算天数 ──
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "id": 7,
    "method": "tools/call",
    "params": {
        "name": "days_until",
        "arguments": {
            "target": "2026-12-25T00:00:00"
        }
    }
}

### ── 9. 调用未知工具（应返回 isError: true）──
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "id": 8,
    "method": "tools/call",
    "params": {
        "name": "nonexistent"
    }
}

### ── 10. OpenFeign 调用 Samples.Api（需先启动 Samples.Api @16600）──
GET {{host}}/feign-test
